<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A0.SS2" title="In Off-The-Shelf Image-to-Image Models Are All You Need To Defeat Image Protection Schemes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">-B</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Case Study 1: Mitigating Deepfake Manipulations (USENIX Security’23)</span></span></a></li>
