<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Off-The-Shelf Image-to-Image Models Are All You Need To Defeat Image Protection Schemes</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Xavier Pleimling<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>
