<section id="A0.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="A0.SS2.6" class="ltx_text">-B</span> </span><span id="A0.SS2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Case Study 1: Mitigating Deepfake Manipulations (USENIX Security’23)</span></h3>

<figure id="A0.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE X: </span>Full denoising results for UnGANable on the best prompt (C6) highlighting its performance on perturbation budgets <math id="A0.T10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon=\{0.05,0.06,0.07\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><mrow><mn>0.05</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.06</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.07</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon=\{0.05,0.06,0.07\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
<table id="A0.T10.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
